{"id":"msg_m_ex_blanc_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_blanc","label":"Blanc · Nikke"},"label":"4. Pit Boss, are you busy?","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_blanc_03","next":"msg_m_ex_blanc_05","speakers":{"blanc":"Blanc"},"icons":{"blanc":"si_c270_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_1","text":"Pit Boss, are you busy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_2","text":"I have a question.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_3","text":"I'm free. What's up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_4","text":"Noir and I just finished a performance,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_5","text":"and some of the audience members","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_6","text":"said that watching our show made them feel incredibly happy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_7","text":"Of course, whenever Noir and I are on the stage,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_8","text":"we hope that everyone has a good time,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_9","text":"but it was still a pleasant surprise to hear someone tell us in person how they felt.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_10","text":"Anyway, that got me thinking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_11","text":"Have you ever enjoyed yourself","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_12","text":"when you see us on stage?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_13","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_14","text":"Wow, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_15","text":"So you also felt happy!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_16","text":"How do you feel, Blanc?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_17","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_18","text":"You mean when I dance?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_19","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_20","text":"Every time I dance,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_21","text":"I'm ecstatic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_22","text":"I've got Noir there beside me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_23","text":"and you're always off-stage, cheering me on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_24","text":"To be able to dance in front of those who appreciate me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_25","text":"is a privilege that always fills me with joy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_26","text":"I'd love to keep doing what I'm doing for forever.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_27","text":"I hope that, too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_28","text":"Well, since we're your good luck charm,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"blanc","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_29","text":"we'll do our best to keep you happy going forward.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_blanc_04_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_blanc_04_30","text":"Looking forward to it!","jump":null}],"chat":true}